# vvaharness/pipeline/stages/replay.py

Shared deadline machinery for agentic stages (Stages 2, 4, 6, 8). A stage call can be bounded by a wall clock; when the clock expires, the stage first tries to resume the same session with one extra instruction, and otherwise re-asks with no tools from the recorded transcript (or the original prompt when no transcript was captured).

Source: `vvaharness/pipeline/stages/replay.py` (lines 1-336)
Executor: mixed (defines replay instructions; the resume and replay model calls are issued by the calling stage through `resume_or_replay`)
Called from: `vvaharness/pipeline/stages/s2/session.py` and the Stage 4, 6 and 8 session modules

